1
00:00:00,027 --> 00:00:01,527
(Bert:)I'm warning you,

2
00:00:01,529 --> 00:00:04,029
(Bert:)hide your good rocks.

3
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:08,113
(Mrs Petrescu:)My sister's husband
took all her things, too.

4
00:00:08,119 --> 00:00:09,499
Story at 11:00.

5
00:00:12,924 --> 00:00:14,794
(Stuart:)Really, no one else is coming?

6
00:00:14,792 --> 00:00:17,342
Oh, this is it.

7
00:00:17,345 --> 00:00:19,265
(Sheldon:)You are the practice round.

8
00:00:19,263 --> 00:00:21,043
(Stuart:)Practice round? For-for what?

9
00:00:21,048 --> 00:00:23,348
(Amy:)Uh, no.
He-he just means that

10
00:00:23,351 --> 00:00:25,221
(Amy:)you were the first people
we thought of.

11
00:00:25,219 --> 00:00:26,269
(Sheldon:)You know, exactly.

12
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:27,550
(Sheldon:)We've never thrown
a brunch before,

13
00:00:27,555 --> 00:00:29,685
(Sheldon:)and I wanted to work
out all the kinks.

14
00:00:31,192 --> 00:00:33,022
(Stuart:)So, I'm like a lab rat

15
00:00:33,027 --> 00:00:35,197
(Stuart:)before your real friends
come over?

16
00:00:37,064 --> 00:00:39,234
(Leonard:)Oh.

17
00:00:39,233 --> 00:00:41,063
(Sheldon:)You see, your words
sound reasonable,

18
00:00:41,068 --> 00:00:42,948
(Sheldon:)but your face
looks angry.

19
00:00:44,455 --> 00:00:47,125
(Sheldon:)Help me out here.
This is not where I shine.

20
00:00:47,125 --> 00:00:48,295
(Sheldon:)Stuart,

21
00:00:48,292 --> 00:00:50,542
(Amy:)you know you're one of
our favorite people.

22
00:00:50,545 --> 00:00:51,915
(Sheldon:)Okay, now, see,
you look sincere,

23
00:00:51,913 --> 00:00:54,213
(Sheldon:)but your words are
completely false.

24
00:00:55,166 --> 00:00:56,716
(Sheldon:)I'm glad we did
this test run.

25
00:00:56,717 --> 00:01:00,027
(Sheldon:)These brunches
are wild!

